{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16818","headline":"闰月定四时 · 罗让","name":"闰月定四时","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月闰随寒暑，畴人定职司。\n余分将考日，积算自成时。\n律候行宜表，阴阳运不欺。\n气薰灰琯验，数仂卦辞推。\n六律文明序，三年理暗移。\n当知岁功立，唯是奉无私。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗让","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16818.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16818","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}